      "content": "where $\\mu$ is the population mean (the fixed effect), $1$ is a $n \\times 1$ column vector of ones (equivalent to the design matrix $\\mathbf{X}$ in Equation 26.1), and the covariance matrix of residuals about the mean is assumed to be $\\mathbf{R} = \\sigma^2 \\mathbf{I}$.",
