      "content": "What are the ML estimates of $ \\mu $ and $ \\sigma^{2} $ based on the n sampled individuals? Assuming the phenotypes are independent of each other and normally distributed, the probability density of the data y conditional on the parametric mean and variance is the product of the n univariate normal densities,",
