      ],
      "source_bboxes": [
        [
          31.0,
          1066.0,
          904.0,
          1129.0
        ]
      ],
      "provenance_score": 1.0,
      "content_sha256": "a9ef098dacf579cdccee6a9499749c5375250f592cc4f101c6daabde004b5193"
    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "The final (stable) solution to this equation, $ \\widehat{\\sigma}^{2} $, is obtained by setting $ \\widehat{\\sigma}^{2}(t+1) = \\widehat{\\sigma}^{2}(t) $, yielding",
      "source_page": 795,
      "printed_page": 775,
      "source_block_ids": [
        "Genetics_chapter27:p005:b16"
      ],
      "bbox": [
        24.0,
        1219.0,
        984.0,
        1315.0
      ],
      "source_pages": [
        795
      ],
      "source_bboxes": [
        [
          24.0,
          1219.0,
          984.0,
          1315.0
        ]
      ],
      "provenance_score": 1.0,
      "content_sha256": "9ec62e2e568b79d71d5bc8c41f70e0290981ec46af3d33288fa6d3c8135c9e27"
    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "[[FORMULA:Genetics_chapter27_formula016]]",
      "source_page": 795,
      "printed_page": 775,
      "source_block_ids": [
        "Genetics_chapter27:p005:b17",
