    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "which is the unbiased estimator of the variance that we normally use (Chapter 2).",
      "source_page": 795,
      "printed_page": 775,
      "source_block_ids": [
        "Genetics_chapter27:p005:b19"
      ],
      "bbox": [
